        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Eva boarded the ship, all she saw ahead was love, light, and vivid visions of a new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She didn’t know that a single moment would turn everything into hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, there’s only one way out — <i>into endless darkness.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“30 Minutes Until My Brain Dies”</strong> is a visual novel where love and hope collide with loneliness and despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, yet piercing story set in the dead silence of space — where outside the hull lies cold emptiness, and inside, memories that won’t let go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 original tracks composed by the game’s creator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric sound design that deepens the emotional experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive locations with point and click elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896070/extras/32e2a57f09d7d3e0bd2e5e831228f72a.poster.avif?t=1766412012\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896070/extras/32e2a57f09d7d3e0bd2e5e831228f72a.webm?t=1766412012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896070/extras/32e2a57f09d7d3e0bd2e5e831228f72a.mp4?t=1766412012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated backgrounds that bring space to life</p><p class=\"bb_pa